---

<section id="stories" class="stories">

  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-title">
      <span class="eyebrow">Stories of Hope</span>
      <h2>Every Life Has the Potential to Change</h2>

      <p>
        Behind every programme is a person, a family, or a community striving
        for a better future. These stories reflect the hope that inspires our
        work and the impact we seek to create every day.
      </p>
    </div>


    <div class="story-grid">

      <article class="story-card">

        <div class="icon">🎓</div>

        <h3>A Child Finds Opportunity</h3>

        <p>
          Education opens doors. Through community support and committed
          partners, vulnerable children gain the opportunity to remain in
          school, pursue their dreams and build brighter futures.
        </p>

      </article>


      <article class="story-card">

        <div class="icon">🌱</div>

        <h3>A Widow Rebuilds with Dignity</h3>

        <p>
          Sustainable livelihoods give families renewed confidence. By helping
          widows develop reliable sources of income, communities become
          stronger, more resilient and more hopeful.
        </p>

      </article>


      <article class="story-card">

        <div class="icon">🤝</div>

        <h3>A Community Grows Stronger</h3>

        <p>
          Lasting change happens when people work together. Volunteers,
          partners, local leaders and community members unite to create
          opportunities that continue transforming lives for years to come.
        </p>

      </article>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<style>

.stories{
padding:100px 8%;
background:#f8fafc;
}

.container{
max-width:1200px;
margin:auto;
}

.section-title{
text-align:center;
max-width:760px;
margin:0 auto 60px;
}

.eyebrow{
display:inline-block;
background:#e8f1fb;
color:#0b4f8a;
padding:8px 18px;
border-radius:30px;
font-weight:700;
margin-bottom:18px;
}

.section-title h2{
font-size:42px;
color:#0f172a;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

.section-title p{
font-size:18px;
line-height:1.8;
color:#555;
}

.story-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
gap:30px;
}

.story-card{
background:white;
padding:40px 30px;
border-radius:18px;
box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
transition:.35s;
text-align:center;
}

.story-card:hover{
transform:translateY(-10px);
}

.icon{
font-size:50px;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

.story-card h3{
font-size:24px;
color:#0b4f8a;
margin-bottom:18px;
}

.story-card p{
color:#555;
line-height:1.8;
}

@media(max-width:900px){

.story-grid{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

.section-title h2{
font-size:34px;
}

}

</style>